{"c":[{"id":"1009588b28818d14","sum":"Slice 2: a goal that observed replays its program on recorded observations and choices (goals/replay.ts), never the writer. Mail windows are conversations (under half per request): mint list cells at their own node or a shared subject charges every row.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T182045Z-7e784e62f684bf75","text":"Slice 2 replay: goal programs are re-run on recorded observations/choices (goals/replay.ts); a goal that observed never calls the writer again, so fresh() returns null for it. Observation values come from a frozen copy obs<n>:<windowId> kept in GoalRuns.sourcesOf.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T182045Z-9c9e184e59259bec","text":"Mail windows are conversations (one request reveals under half): mint each list cell at its own node (wholePart(nodePart(key,'label'))), or a subject several rows share charges every row and the rows get cut.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"696261eff2d2443c","sum":"Host auth: host: true hello gets only hostChallenge until hostProof (key HMAC(secret,'caret-host-key')); tests: authenticateHost, Caret via CARET_HOST_KEY_FD. #26: reader fieldInput and page inputAt feed InputWatch; input on the target sets mayIncludeInput, Undo refuses.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T184417Z-0281f0608f009ca0","text":"Host auth: a host: true hello gets hostChallenge and nothing else until a valid hostProof (key = HMAC(launch secret,'caret-host-key')); helper tests give HelperServer a secret and call authenticateHost (test/socket-reader.ts); attached Caret is host only via CARET_HOST_KEY_FD.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T190928Z-cced71498674f91b","text":"Issue #26: reader fieldInput (keys but Esc, element from cached focus, none after Tab) and page PageControl.inputAt feed executor InputWatch from send time; input on the target makes the recovery read unknown and sets mayIncludeInput so Undo refuses.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
